  "unresolved_added": [
    "The paper claims16 abiotic variables, but Table4.1 uses ellipses and exposes only part of the dictionary; factor fitting, scaling and rotation parameters are not fully supplied. Keep the printed HDVI label and missing rows as source gaps.",
    "Monthly cluster counts are explicitly supplied and must not be called missing. However, fitting initialization, complete covariance estimation, software routine and convergence protocol remain underreported.",
    "258+258=516, whereas411+177=588. The source does not reconcile the difference. It also downloads external images; their admissibility under the supplied-data task boundary needs explicit resolution rather than quiet acceptance.",
    "The CNN final predictor is selected at the93rd epoch by peak test accuracy, so that test set also acts as a selection set. Groupwise isolation of augmented originals, upstream out-of-fold scores and independent pseudo-label evaluation are not established.",
    "The stated N/(N+P)=.262045 conflicts with the displayed count solution:3251/4440=.732207 and1189/4440=.267793. Neither equals.262045. Do not fix this by merely swappingN andP.",
    "The nonempty branch alone does not guarantee a positive denominator: if every retained term hasglobalfrequency1, sum(log(c_w))=0. The source does not specify that corner-case fallback.",
    "The fitted exponentsC1=-39.3 andC2=-4.4 require strictly positive channel inputs. AtP_im=P_n=1, the printed formula and parameters give approximately4.976174, outside[0,1]; at zero the negative powers are undefined. No global probability-domain guarantee is supplied.",
